    <bpmn:process id="W_W2496" name="W2496. Bad Debt Write-Off Decision" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Account determined uncollectible after all recovery efforts
Frequency: ~10–15 write-offs/year
Volume: ~10–15/year; ~PHP 5–15M total write-offs/year
Owner: Finance Controller
Participants: Finance Dir, Credit Analyst, Legal, CFO
Source: workflow W2496 — Bad Debt Write-Off Decision</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2496_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2496_Lane1" name="Credit Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2496_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2496_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2496_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2496_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2496_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2496_Start4" name="Account determined uncollectible after all recovery efforts">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2496_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2496_Task5" name="Credit Analyst presents write-off recommendation: collection history, legal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Credit Analyst presents write-off recommendation: collection history, legal status, customer financial situation, recovery probability; Finance Controller reviews; CFO approves; Board approves &gt;PHP 1M per account
Responsible (R): Credit Analyst / Finance Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–3 days per write-off</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2496_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2496_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2496_Task6" name="Finance processes write-off: removes from AR, adjusts bad debt provision…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance processes write-off: removes from AR, adjusts bad debt provision, records in GL, updates customer account status; account flagged for no future credit; COD only
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2496_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2496_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2496_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2496_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-435 (ensure controlled execution — Bad Debt Recovery &amp; Write-Off Management (PA-68.3).) | - CTL-435 (credit-authorization — links to VS-16 / W24); Operational: Finance Controller sign-off on the workflow output
Owner: Finance Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
